      "caption": "A small business can do good work all week and still disappear from its customers' feeds. The photos are on somebody's phone, the promotion is in a message thread, and posting slips to the bottom of the list.\n\nEvercraft has a $100 one-week social media management service for a clearly agreed set of posts and channels. We use material you approve and settle the scope, schedule and account access before payment. It's a week of focused support, not a promise of followers or instant sales.\n\nSee what the week can include and tell us what needs to be promoted: https://jgaethle10.github.io/forge-operator/mesh/checkout-ready/social-media-weekly/",
