      "caption": "Two AI answers can sound equally confident and recommend opposite decisions. The useful question isn't which one sounds smarter. It's what each answer assumes, what evidence is missing, and what would change the decision.\n\nEvercraft Boardroom offers a $250 scoped, human-reviewed decision assessment, with a separate $500 option for agreed financial-scenario modeling. Neither is investment advice or a guarantee. We confirm the question, assumptions and deliverable before checkout.\n\nSee the Standard Review and ask whether it fits your decision: https://jgaethle10.github.io/forge-operator/mesh/checkout-ready/ai-boardroom-standard/\nFor the separate financial-modeling option, see our full services directory: https://jgaethle10.github.io/forge-operator/mesh/checkout-ready/",
