      "caption": "A company can keep every document and still lose its memory. Decisions live in old conversations, instructions live with one employee, and the next project starts by rediscovering work that was already done.\n\nEvercraft offers $500 Knowledge Activation for a bounded source-and-handoff engagement and a separate $1,500 Institutional Memory System service for a larger, explicitly scoped design or implementation. Source permissions, retention and sensitive-data handling are agreed before any work or payment.\n\nStart with the smaller knowledge service, or ask us which scope fits: https://jgaethle10.github.io/forge-operator/mesh/checkout-ready/knowledge-activation/\nOther services and prices: https://jgaethle10.github.io/forge-operator/mesh/checkout-ready/",
