      "caption": "Publishing more content is not the same as understanding who it's helping. If a business can't explain which audience it's reaching, what questions people keep asking, or what it should test next, more posts can just create more noise.\n\nEvercraft's $1,000 Social Intelligence Launch is a project-based engagement to define an audience, review approved evidence and organize a practical next-step plan. We agree on accessible data, deliverables and capacity before taking payment. No bought engagement, invented results or growth guarantees.\n\nExplore the scope here: https://jgaethle10.github.io/forge-operator/mesh/checkout-ready/social-intelligence-launch/",
